会中国男篮14人公示名单出炉，胡金秋领衔，杨瀚森与赵继伟缺席。这份名单的底色不是最强12人，而是篮协一体化备战思路下的战略取舍。自5月组队以来，男篮世界杯资格赛、女篮世界杯与亚运会统筹规划，亚运被清晰界定为以赛代练、为奥运蓄力的战场。因此杨瀚森返美备战NBA、韩旭李月汝征战WNBA均未纳入，赵继...'}, 'long_summary': '2026年名古屋亚运会中国男篮14人公示名单出炉，胡金秋领衔，杨瀚森与赵继伟缺席。这份名单的底色不是最强12人，而是篮协一体化备战思路下的战略取舍。因此杨瀚森返美备战NBA、韩旭李月汝征战WNBA均未纳入，赵继伟等老将出于身体保护休整。胡金秋当打且高效，是攻防绝对核心。对比上届杭州亚运周琦、王哲林、胡金秋三塔并立，本届杨瀚森赴NBA后，内线高度全压在胡余二人身上，厚度明显削减。郭士强必须解决的难题，是胡金秋下场后的护框断档，一旦核心陷入犯规困扰或体能瓶颈，第二高度余嘉豪的成色将直接决定内线下限。'}, {'id': '20260824V00TJE00', 'articletype': '4', 'title': '“羞答答”的机器人跑了第一 网友：跑这么快有啥不好意思的', 'pic_style': 4, 'publish_time': '2026-08-24 00:57:04', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oa1TwwsCt8BifCoDx36W3O3F956QzsLJ9ZhUjGE84k7jAAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oa1TwwsCt8BifCoDx36W3O3F956QzsLJ9ZhUjGE84k7jAAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/ORiO23rU8KkbpWx3UJhDi4XEaJ6V0CoG85aw4PF-18nHgAA_150120/0'], 'ls_img_exp_type': '1', 'ext': {'640x360': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oa1TwwsCt8BifCoDx36W3O3F956QzsLJ9ZhUjGE84k7jAAA_640360/0', '196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oa1TwwsCt8BifCoDx36W3O3F956QzsLJ9ZhUjGE84k7jAAA_196130/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oa1TwwsCt8BifCoDx36W3O3F956QzsLJ9ZhUjGE84k7jAAA_330330/0', '480x640': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oa1TwwsCt8BifCoDx36W3O3F956QzsLJ9ZhUjGE84k7jAAA_480640/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OSkVa-eMPKCKHw8ZvYmP8HpKR1-VfSw3X87Ccp60MRBZMAA_240240/0', 'aspect': '0.68', 'pic_first': 'https://puui.qpic.cn/vpic_cover/i3295uer3hg/i3295uer3hg_first.jpg/720'}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260824V00TJE00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260824V00TJE00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260824V00TJE00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260824V00TJE00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '58', 'chl_name': '央视新闻', 'icon': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OmxeZrWt-_zm2s_4wsWITzAFL3V3Hl-zFOdQxF7BRIdI4AA_200200/0', 'sicon': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OmxeZrWt-_zm2s_4