增长40%。拼多多表示，今年上半年继续推进“千亿扶持”以及“三年再造拼多多”等战略，其中“千亿扶持”主要面向平台商家、农产区和产业带提供流量、费用及供应链等方面支持；“三年再造拼多多”则进一步向供应链和自营品牌业务延伸。拼多多集团联席董事长兼联席CEO赵佳臻表示，公司正在升级平台治理体系，并进一步加大供应链相关投入。'}, {'id': '20260824A0B9OZ00', 'articletype': '0', 'title': '光连接三家公司同时公布半年报，走势为何完全不同？', 'pic_style': 0, 'publish_time': '2026-08-24 19:31:15', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oyr3E0vkQShwi00b8rhFTqnEfBhuDYOZ_T2HxPO8yvARwAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oyr3E0vkQShwi00b8rhFTqnEfBhuDYOZ_T2HxPO8yvARwAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oyr3E0vkQShwi00b8rhFTqnEfBhuDYOZ_T2HxPO8yvARwAA_197130/0'], 'ls_img_exp_type': '1', 'ext': {'196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oyr3E0vkQShwi00b8rhFTqnEfBhuDYOZ_T2HxPO8yvARwAA_196130/0', '360x240': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oyr3E0vkQShwi00b8rhFTqnEfBhuDYOZ_T2HxPO8yvARwAA_360240/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oyr3E0vkQShwi00b8rhFTqnEfBhuDYOZ_T2HxPO8yvARwAA_330330/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/Or4jo2xl1UUtGtjjYwlchBpac7xpJEQYx7bVUNGc_rgmEAA_240240/0', 'img_count': 9}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260824A0B9OZ00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260824A0B9OZ00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260824A0B9OZ00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260824A0B9OZ00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '5106679', 'chl_name': '价值线财经', 'icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/252171014_200200/0', 'sicon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/252171014_200200/0', 'mrk': '《价值线》为5000万中产阶级和高净值人群提供大数据时代最新的价值观察和理财选择，分享诗意生活。', 'last_art_update': '0', 'uin': 'ec141c344b115a8a32', 'encoded_suid': '8QMd3nte7YIfuA==', 'vip_type': '30012', 'vip_type_new': '30012', 'vip_desc': '价值线财经官方账号', 'vip_icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14876051701/0', 'medal_info': {'type_id': 26, 'medal_id': 40, 'medal_level': 1, 'medal_name': '万众瞩目', 'medal_desc': '腾讯新闻粉丝数达到1w', 'night_url': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14465644517/0', 'daytime_u